      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "comb-draft-002",
      "topicId": "comb",
      "factText": "塑料梳常用两半模具注塑，合模边界可能在细小齿尖留下锐利分模线；后处理可先粗化齿尖，再蘸涂并干燥成圆滑端点。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-comb-molded-tooth-finish"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
